HYP-2937 MARKED C27 TRANSFERS INTO Q=3 UNITAL BLOCKS
==============================================================================
[q=3 Hermitian unital verification]
  points=28; blocks=63
  design={'blocks': 63, 'block_size_hist': {4: 63}, 'point_rep_hist': {9: 28}, 'pair_rep_hist': {1: 378}}
  affine labels use C27 residues via base-3 digits r=d0+3*d1+9*d2:
    r=0  -> (X,Y,Z)=(0, 0, 1)
    r=1  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 2, 1)
    r=2  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 1, 2)
    r=3  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, w, 2w)
    r=4  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 2+w, 2+w)
    r=5  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 1+w, 1+w)
    r=6  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 2w, w)
    r=7  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 2+2w, 2+2w)
    r=8  -> (X,Y,Z)=(1, 1+2w, 1+2w)
  warning: this is a C27 -> F3^3 digit lift, not a cyclic action lift.

