[Readout]
  Positive: the q=3 unital gives a real lambda=1 block carrier: every
  marked C27 point-pair transfer lands in a unique 4-point block.
  Negative/guardrail: the natural 27-point affine chart is F3^3.  The
  C27 cyclic carry is not an automorphism of this lift, so block patterns
  are label-dependent unless a stronger C27-compatible marking is proved.
  Useful proof role: use unital blocks as a pair-incidence ledger after
  AP/GW shell labels are fixed; do not treat the unital as a standalone
  LRC invariant.
